F6.statement:
Measurement recommendations include:
- validated devices with an appropriately sized upper-arm cuff;
- bilateral arm measurement at the first visit;
- home BP monitoring advised in all treated patients;
- ABPM for diurnal patterns and nocturnal hypertension.

The ERBP commentary notes that the 2025 AHA/ACC guideline accepts office BP confirmed on at least two occasions, ABPM or HBPM for diagnosis.
